## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

Intimate Diffusion separates skin intimacy from projection. EB is the sole current musk because it alone has a working neat w/w basis; Hedione, Ethyl Linalool, and Iso E carry the aura while cardamom, lavender, cedar, vetiver, coumarin, and tonka remain legible. Habanolide and Romandolide are not dosed until their stock bases are recorded. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-10.json`.

